  "title": {
   "en": "Tensei Arasaa Joshi no Kotoyo Kaikatsu - Seiryaku Kekkon wa Iya na no de, Zatsugaku Chishiki de Tanoshii Kaikaku Life wo Kekkou Shichaimasu!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "転生アラサー女子の異世改活 政略結婚は嫌なので、雑学知識で楽しい改革ライフを決行しちゃいます！"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Reincarnated 30-Something Woman’s Isekai Reform Life: I Hate Political Marriages, So I’ll Use My Trivia Knowledge to Start a Fun Revolution!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "ja": "One morning, a woman in her 30s living an ordinary life wakes up to find that she has been reincarnated as Magnolia, the daughter of the Gilmore Marquis family...!? She is excited about the prospect of a carefree life, but what awaits her there is confinement to her own room and mistreatment from her family. Unable to bear it any longer, Magnolia decides to escape from the Gilmore family in order to seek freedom and live alone!!"
  },
